### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

### Current Weather
GET http://localhost:8000/api/weather/current

### Weather History
GET http://localhost:8000/api/weather/history?limit=5

### System Usage
GET http://localhost:8000/api/system/usage

### Swagger Schema
GET http://localhost:8000/api/schema/

### Swagger UI (Open in browser)
# http://localhost:8000/api/docs/

### 3-Day Forecast
GET http://localhost:8000/api/weather/forecast

### Weather Trends (Last 7 days)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/weather/trends?days=7

### Weather Trends (Last 14 days)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/weather/trends?days=14

### Rate Limit Test (run multiple times quickly)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/weather/current